        "title": "米: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "米 is a meter in length expressions. The number precedes it directly; this use differs from 米 meaning rice.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这条路长三百米。",
                "pinyin": "zhè tiáo lù cháng sān bǎi mǐ 。",
                "meaning": "This road is three hundred meters long.",
                "audio": "4c6f35c03d77908cc13289398ec9f3301243439d72d01fdab8d60ec6fcab4dfb"
              },
              {
                "text": "桌子高一米。",
                "pinyin": "zhuōzi gāo yī mǐ 。",
                "meaning": "The table is one meter high.",
